*                                                                       SCC00050
*      APPLIES NOISE RECORD I-O PROCEEDURE TO CORRECT READS OR WRITES   SCC00060
*      THAT TAPE CHECKED.  WILL NOT CORRECT READS OR WRITES THAT DO NOT SCC00070
*      USE I-O PROGRAMS THAT MOVE TAPE OVER A FIXED NUMBER OF RECORDS   SCC00080
*      REGARDLESS OF FORMAT (EXCLUDING OCCURENCE OF EOF RECORDS).       SCC00090
*                                                                       SCC00100
*      SETS C(CHERR) BITS ON -                                          SCC00110
*        8      - A REEL WAS COMPLETED AND CHANGED.                     SCC00120
*        9      - REEL MUST BE CHANGED.                                 SCC00130
*       10      - I-O ACTION NOT CORRECTABLE BY IOSCC.                  SCC00140
*       11      - I-O PROGRAM NOT ACCEPTABLE PER IOSCC.                 SCC00150
*       12      - I-O PROGRAM INCURRED PREMATURE DISCONNECT.            SCC00160
*       13      - IOSCC WAS UNABLE TO CORRECTLY READ ONE OR MORE RECORDSSCC00170
*                 /OR IN REWRITING CREATED ONE OR MORE NOISE RECORDS.   SCC00180
*                                                                       SCC00190
*      CLA*    $IOCNT   COUNT OF RECORDS PER I-O PROGRAM EXECUTED, B17. SCC00200
