*IOENB  I-O ENABLE SPG. FOR IOPAR - R. NORRIS - SAO - AUG. 61           ENB00020
*                                                                       ENB00030
*           THIS SUBPROGRAM PROVIDES DATA CHANNEL MODE FOR IOPAR, SUCH  ENB00040
*                       THAT I-O ACTIONS TERMINATED BY EOF COND. OR BY  ENB00050
*                       IOXT COND., WILL BE AUTOMATICALLY COMPLETED AND ENB00060
*                       CHECKED AT TRAP TIME, WHETHER OR NOT CPU IS     ENB00070
*                       BEING DELAYED BY FINIO.                         ENB00080
*                                                                       ENB00090
*      TSX $IOENB,4     CPU WILL BE DELAYED VIA FINIO UNTIL PREVIOUS    ENB00100
*                       ACTIONS ARE COMPLETED, AND THEN PUT IOPAR INTO  ENB00110
*                       D.C.T. MODE.                                    ENB00120
*      TSX $IODSB,4     WILL DISABEL D.C.T. AND RESTORE TRAP LOCATIONS  ENB00130
*                       TO PRE-IOENB STATUS.                            ENB00140
*                                                                       ENB00150
*                       A CALL TO IOENB (IODSB) WITHOUT AN INTERVENING  ENB00160
*                        CALL TO IODSB (IOENB) WILL BE EQUIVALENT TO A  ENB00170
*                        NOP ( XEC* $DSB ) .                            ENB00180
*                                                                       ENB00190
*      TSX $INTRG,4     SET IOENB TO XEC TWO ONE INSTRUCTION SUBPROGRAMSENB00200
*                       AFTER COMPLETION OF TRAP PGS. AT TRAP TIME.     ENB00210
*      TSX  ONE,0        ONE - LOC OF FIRST SUBPROGRAM.                 ENB00220
*      TSX  TWO,0        TWO - LOC OF SECOND SUBPG.                     ENB00230
*                                                                       ENB00240
*      NZT*   $ENBFG    SKIP IF IOENB CALLED WITHOUT SUBSEQUENT CALL    ENB00250
*                        TO IODSB                                       ENB00260
*                                                                       ENB00270
